<title>USA: Summit Properties sees $4.3 mln Q2 gain.</title>
<headline>Summit Properties sees $4.3 mln Q2 gain.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summit Properties Inc said Wednesday that it sold Summit Charleston, an apartment community in Charlotte, North Carolina, for $9,475,000.</p>
<p>Summit said it will record a non-recurring gain of about $4.3 million in the second quarter 1997 from the sale and use proceeds for reinvestment in new acquisitions and development communities.</p>
</text>
